      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. it's a good start. i guess i'm wondering though, some people say that calling regulation 'red tape' is just a way for big companies to avoid accountability. do u think that's a fair critique, or is the 'innovation' argument more central to how the economy actually works?",
